note contract 5 abstract lines 140-143: `and` is a preserving operation but is not listed on the
note abstract line (ops rotr xor), so it needs open first. Erratum E8: error 7.
om2
abstract dup32 ulong ops rotr xor
holds dup32 dup32
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or shl ulong x 32 ulong x
end
fn main to int
d = dup32mk 5
e = and d d
puth open e
ret 0
end
